---
import { withBase } from '../../lib/events';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteNav from '../../components/SiteNav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../../lib/events';

const title = `Privacy — ${SITE_NAME}`;
const description = `What ${SITE_NAME} collects, what it doesn't, and why.`;
---

<Base title={title} description={description} path="/privacy/">
	<SiteNav />

	<main class="wrap legal">
		<h1>Privacy</h1>
		<p class="todo">Skeleton only. The owner must supply every marked value before go-live and name the processors actually used; this is not legal advice and the final text should be reviewed.</p>

		<h2>Controller (Verantwortlicher, Art. 4 GDPR)</h2>
		<p>[[TODO: owner to supply name, address and email]]. See the <a href={withBase('/impressum/')}>Impressum</a>.</p>

		<h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
		<p>
			[[TODO: owner to confirm the host. Currently GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc., USA), which keeps
			server logs; add legal basis, retention and the transfer mechanism.]]
		</p>

		<h2>Fonts</h2>
		<p>The typeface is served from this site itself; no request goes to a font provider.</p>

		<h2>Analytics</h2>
		<p>[[TODO: owner to state the analytics tool and what it records, or that none is used.]]</p>

		<h2>Links to organisers</h2>
		<p>
			Registration buttons link to the organiser's own page and carry a tag
			(<code>utm_source</code>) so organisers can see that a visitor came from here. What the
			organiser's page does with your data is governed by their privacy policy.
		</p>

		<h2>The weekly digest</h2>
		<p>[[TODO: owner to describe the digest, the processor (Buttondown, LLC, USA), double opt-in, legal basis (consent), the transfer mechanism and how to unsubscribe.]]</p>

		<h2>Contact and event-submission forms</h2>
		<p>[[TODO: owner to describe the processor (FormSubmit) and what is sent.]]</p>

		<h2>Your rights</h2>
		<p>[[TODO: owner to supply access, correction, deletion, objection and complaint rights (supervisory authority).]]</p>

		<p class="updated">Last updated: [[TODO: date]].</p>
	</main>

	<SiteFooter />

	<style>
		.legal {
			padding: 24px 32px 64px;
			max-width: 640px;
		}
		h1 {
			font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2rem);
			margin: 16px 0 8px;
			letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		}
		h2 {
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			font-weight: 600;
			margin: 28px 0 6px;
		}
		p {
			margin: 0;
			line-height: 1.65;
			color: var(--ink-2);
		}
		.intro {
			color: var(--muted);
		}
		code {
			font-size: 0.85em;
			background: var(--chip-bg);
			padding: 1px 5px;
		}
		.todo {
			margin: 0 0 16px;
			padding: 10px 12px;
			background: var(--chip-bg);
			font-size: 0.85rem;
		}
		.updated {
			margin-top: 36px;
			font-size: 0.82rem;
			color: var(--muted);
		}
		@media (max-width: 640px) {
			.legal {
				padding: 16px 18px 48px;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Base>
